{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Prepares for Final Exams"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Do You Mind If ..."}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le10ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Permission"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you ask for permission, it is important to be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You often use a modal like <span class=\"italic\">can, may, could</span> to ask for permission."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also ask a Yes or No question like \u201c<span class=\"italic\">Is it OK if \u2026 </span>\u201d or \u201c<span class=\"italic\">Would you mind if \u2026 </span>\u201d"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some ways to ask for and give permission."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I sit here?</br</br> Would you mind if I borrow your notes after class?</br></br> Can I photocopy them?</br></br> Could I use your textbook this evening?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure!</br></br> I guess not.</br></br>  Alright.</br></br> OK, no problem.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Promises"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future tense (with <span class=\"italic\">will</span>) to make promises.<br/>For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I'll phone him back immediately, I'll do it at once.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I promise I'll be a good partner.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>:  Great!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll buy my copy next week.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>: OK, no problem."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can respond to promises with an expression like:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Great, thank you!</br> I'm sure you will.</br> Alright.</br> OK.</br> That's fine.</br> Sure, that works.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "economics"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the study of the economy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I borrow your Economics notes?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about school."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "calculus"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a branch of mathematics"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you talking Calculus this term?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "teamwork"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "two or more people working together towards a common objective"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I believe in teamwork."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "project"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a specific task of work or study"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Looks like we're going to be partners for the accounting project."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enge